From a755176eea6857483771963837d767837cf4e76e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:22:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rewire cinematic layer, add Channel Jump portal + preloader,
 fix dead app links

- Re-wire cinema/ (dropped from index.html in d93b085): stylesheet, #cinema
  canvas + CSS fallback, hero headline, finale, module entry, .cin failsafe.
- Fix root-absolute paths that break on the /StreamCloud/ Pages project URL
  (scene.js three import, cinema.css mask url, logo-manifest.js).
- Fix choreography so cards/rows re-rendered by filters, search and mode
  switches are observed (previously stayed hidden under .cin).
- Replace 10 dead /download/app/* routes (needed the deleted server.js) with
  each app's official page or GitHub Releases page, per the old resolver config.
- New cinema/portal.js + portal.css: canvas-masked tilting "Channel Jump"
  window that expands, switches Websites/Apps, and irises onto the catalog.
  Content is generated from the catalog + local logos (no remote media).
  Keyboard, touch and reduced-motion paths included.
- New cinema/preloader.js: real-progress counter in the existing intro, logo
  flies to the nav slot; hard 4.5s failsafe retained.
- Use local logo marks as a fallback source before generic favicon services.
- sw.js: cache v2, precache cinema modules, vendor three and local logos.
- Docs: project map and path rules.
